{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-05/1044380/block/singleImage/3162720/df/01KR2YNHWTAF3N8ERNNJCVQQQT.jpeg?updatedAt=1785310596\"/><figcaption>香港警方</figcaption></figure><p>旺角發生一宗涉及警車的交通意外。 今日（29日）早上10時27分，一輛巡邏警車於旺角汝州街7-9號對開位置，將一名過路的92歲婆婆撞倒，婆婆膊頭及腳部擦傷，清醒由救護車送往廣華醫院治理。警方正在調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T08:21:20.978865+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"}}